00:05:17.275 --> 00:05:30.995
28 million dollars of deferred revenue from magnetic precursor products, expected to be realized over coming quarters, is the extra execution line to watch, and the same quarterly report check the dividend screen uses is the habit here.

00:05:30.995 --> 00:05:34.275
