00:10:47.108 --> 00:10:52.368
misconception. The fix is stating the measurable event that must occur inside the holding window

00:10:52.368 --> 00:10:54.228
and exiting only if it does.

00:10:54.868 --> 00:10:57.688
Remember, the thesis dies on the data point you named,

00:10:58.028 --> 00:10:59.348
not on the first red day.

